{"v":4,"catch":"在自己的故事中誕生的惡夢中生存。","desc":"Bad Parenthood 讓您陷入心理恐怖，睡前故事會變成醒來的噩夢。在一個被講故事的人所纏擾的郊區家庭中遊戲，講故事的人是一個從父母的警告和童年恐懼中誕生的陰險實體。\n\n主要特色：\n- 植根於家庭動力與童年恐懼的心理恐怖遊戲\n- 生存遊戲中的選擇會影響恐怖的程度\n- 透過陰森的筆記、繪畫和秘密講述環境故事\n- 身歷其境的音效讓恐怖栩栩如生\n\nBad Parenthood 迫使您面對自己所創造的怪物 - 您能保護家人遠離您所喚醒的恐懼嗎？","publisher":"Tashlik","release":"2025-02-06","genres":["冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"ClassⅡ","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/959a74872662e9c9bfb19eab6a15f4addd09d3db4f44c46f2778be0bb0af692a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a7871b1ac2ca8e3afdb7fc302cdcac7fd65ab0e967374cbacd7523e23d79c177.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/86852e2485547807653de4513e459ab1ec6d1ee311b19ba26d488189c3afe3b2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/49eb1cc92d71b9d3f68b6c406ac1c1eef317300410d14bdcf87df07dbb3840bf.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/36cebd7cb2d3a62251856fd0af9d926d45be2edc78aa31434b6f79b9645ed4e1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fb59f7c6be1eee21e916194021e02e18afba2c443fa5872f5f47e4322edcbc22.jpg"],"titleId":"01003ce021bea000","dlc":[]}